  "body": "Positioned to capture expansive, breathtaking sea views, this substantial family home at 254 Whangaparaoa Road offers space, flexibility and an impressive coastal outlook – all set on a generous 871sqm freehold site in popular Red Beach.\r\n\r\nSpread across two levels with approximately 250sqm of floor area, the home provides an excellent layout for large or extended families.\r\n\r\nUpstairs features three bedrooms and two bathrooms, together with the main living spaces where the elevated position makes the most of those spectacular sea views. Whether relaxing at home or entertaining family and friends, the ever-changing coastal outlook provides a stunning backdrop to everyday living.\r\n\r\nDownstairs offers a further two bedrooms and one bathroom, creating valuable additional space for teenagers, extended family, guests or those working from home.\r\n\r\nWith five bedrooms, three bathrooms and generous living space, there is plenty of room for everyone to spread out while still enjoying the comfort of one family home.\r\n\r\nSet on 871sqm of freehold land, the property combines substantial family living with the relaxed coastal lifestyle Red Beach is known for. Beaches, local schools, shops and everyday amenities are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nHighlights include:\r\n•\tExpansive sea and coastal views\r\n•\t5 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and 2 living rooms\r\n•\tApprox. 250sqm floor area\r\n•\t871sqm freehold site\r\n•\t3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms upstairs\r\n•\t2 bedrooms and 1 bathroom downstairs\r\n•\tFlexible layout ideal for large or extended families\r\n•\tGenerous family living and entertaining spaces\r\n•\tConvenient Red Beach location\r\n\r\nBig on space, big on views and full of potential – this is a home that needs to be seen to truly appreciate the outlook.",
